OL,3,ARemains of dozens of suspected kidnap
OL,4,Avictims found in Nigerian forests
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe skulls and bones of at least 28
OL,7,Fpeople have been recovered from
OL,8,Fsuspected criminal camps in Nigerian
OL,9,Fforests.
OL,11,FPolice in the south-eastern state of
OL,12,FAbia are investigating the identities
OL,13,Fof the remains found in the Umuaku and
OL,14,FNneato forests on Saturday after a
OL,15,Fsecurity operation was carried out in
OL,16,Fthe Umunneochi area.
OL,18,FPolice spokeswoman Maureen Chinaka said
OL,19,Fthe suspects fled when police arrived.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
