OL,3,ARemains of dozens of suspected kidnap
OL,4,Avictims found in Nigerian forests
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe discovery is likely to revive
OL,7,Fconcerns about kidnapping gangs
OL,8,Foperating in remote forests across
OL,9,Fparts of south-eastern Nigeria, where
OL,10,Fcriminal groups have frequently
OL,11,Ftargeted motorists, travellers and
OL,12,Fresidents for ransom.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
